  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-237497\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>Let's start by interpreting our model:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>The model shows <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"21\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> wholes split into sevenths.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-2418ffaebec8acd9debdeadafa19e9f5\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/2418ffaebec8acd9debdeadafa19e9f5\"></div> \n</li>\n<li><p>There are <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"22\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: lightgray;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.9em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.9em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathbackground=\"lightgray\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mn>5</mn></mpadded></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> sevenths in each group, with <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"23\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: moccasin;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.9em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.9em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathbackground=\"Moccasin\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mn>3</mn></mpadded></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> remaining.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-31110e78dce8c3d2fcf5dcb0e6501cef\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/31110e78dce8c3d2fcf5dcb0e6501cef\"></div> \n\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Note the following: </p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>There are <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"24\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mn>5</mn></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> full groups. </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>There are <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"25\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: moccasin;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.9em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.9em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathbackground=\"Moccasin\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mn>3</mn></mpadded></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> sevenths left over out of a possible group of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"26\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: lightgray;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.9em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.9em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathbackground=\"lightgray\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mn>5</mn></mpadded></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> So the fractional part of our answer is \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"27\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: moccasin;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.9em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.9em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: lightgray;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.9em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.9em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mstyle mathbackground=\"Moccasin\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mn>3</mn></mpadded></mstyle><mstyle mathbackground=\"lightgray\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mn>5</mn></mpadded></mstyle></mfrac></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore,\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"28\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cF7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"3\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"